<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs032" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Priorities in rank order as a numbered staircase under a working title, the first item the top step, each a short title and one line.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="p_UQvCR3sH"><h2>The fixes, in the order we make them</h2><smart-layout cell-size="10" variant="staircase"><smart-layout-item><h4>Second warehouse shift</h4><p>Capacity back before the autumn cycle.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Standing-schedule routes</h4><p>Fixed delivery days for repeat accounts.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>New-line relaunch</h4><p>Training and pricing to the sales team.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Third-site review</h4><p>A decision in September, on the numbers.</p></smart-layout-item></smart-layout></grid-item></grid></section>